    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 100 of the laws of 2013, relating to authorizing the\nreinstatement of prior approved work permits and waiving the requirements of\nsection 35 and subdivision 2 of section 36 of the general city law as such\nprovisions relate to rebuilding and repairing homes devastated by Hurricane\nSandy in the city of New York, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S9206",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S9206-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
      {
       "alternate": false,
